OL,3,GNEWSAChef award sees first female
OL,4,Awinner in 50 years
OL,5,
OL,6,FA North Yorkshire chef has said she is
OL,7,F"really proud" to be the first woman in
OL,8,F50 years to win a prestigious industry
OL,9,Faward.
OL,11,FRuth Hansom, owner of Hansom Restaurant
OL,12,Fin Bedale, has been crowned the Craft
OL,13,FGuild of Chefs' National Chef of the
OL,14,FYear.
OL,16,FAt Tuesday's grand final, Hansom went
OL,17,Fhead-to-head with nine other chefs, all
OL,18,Fof whom are considered to be among the
OL,19,Fcountry's culinary elite.
OL,23,APub: 10-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,388,380,200,160,0,100
